    "title": "CosmoProf Beauty",
    "description": "Every artist needs an ally.\r\n\r\nThe Cosmo Prof app is made to fit the changing needs of today\u2019s professional stylist and support them in their beauty business. \r\n\r\nRunning low? Last-minute client? We\u2019ve got you. \r\n\r\nOrder all your favorite products, find some new ones, track your packages and get the supplies you need, when you need them. \r\n\r\nYou can also gain access to exclusive offers. \r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Updated Quick Order for placing fast bulk orders\r\n\u2022 Enhanced product barcode scanning\r\n\u2022 Improved Search functions (voice & barcode capabilities)\r\n\u2022 Improved Checkout\r\n\u2022 Improved Order History and Order Tracking\r\n\u2022 Easy access to Cosmo Prof Card\r\n\u2022 Add multiple hair-color shades to your cart at once\r\n\r\nCOSMO PROF GO \r\n\u2022 Products on demand for stylists in demand",
